  family evidence
  domain Evidence / Time
  layer evidence
  semantic_question Which time is this -- event, publication, observation, retrieval, effective, supersession, correction, expiration?
  purpose Timestamps must not collapse. Stale-for-decision does not mean delete the historical evidence.
