  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_evidence_graphs.py.archive
  node_types TimedFact
  edge_types supersedes
  forbidden_inference retrieval time -> event time
  forbidden_inference stale for a decision -> delete the historical evidence
  source_lineage run6/run7 evidence estate
  known_gap the occurrence spine keeps one ordering, not the eight time planes
  known_gap every source this entry names is archived, so nothing here is a live implementation a reader can open and run. Whether a native owner has taken this work over is not established in this entry; until one is named and witnessed here, the architecture stands on retired code.
